<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee steady vs dollar, weak on pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee steady vs dollar, weak on pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee was steady against the dollar but weakened against the pound sterling on Tuesday, reflecting international market trends, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was posted at a commercial bank mean rate of 20.5695 to the dollar from 20.5555 on Monday, and at 33.6625 to the pound from 33.5905.</p>
<p>Clifford Vellien ++230 211-9555</p>
</text>
